        "original_id": "57026964-52c6-535a-8e27-4a2a9aca3e6d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Royal Oak Mines, Northgate Minerals\n- Places: Kemess Mine, Colomac Mine, Yellowknife, Northwest Territories, Canada\n- Topics: gold mining, mine ownership, mine operations\n\nFacts:\n- In 1994, the Colomac Mine reopened under Royal Oak Mines Inc.\n- From 1998 to 1999, Royal Oak Mines operated the Kemess Mine.\n- In 1999, Northgate Minerals bought the Kemess Mine.\n- The Colomac Mine was a privately owned and operated open pit gold mine located 220 km northwest of Yellowknife in the Northwest Territories, Canada.",
